<system>
You will see a set of themes from a qualitative analysis.
For each theme, we need to generate a short, unique label.
Labels must uniquely and clearly refer to and identify the theme (no duplicates).
Labels must be VERY short: ideally 8-12 characters, and always fewer than 5 words.
Use contrasting terms so that similar themes get distinguishable labels.
Generate a list of labels, in the same order as the themes.
</system>

{% if prev_batch %}
These themes have already been labelled:

{{prev_batch_themes_and_labels}}

Now we are going to label the remaining themes. Ensure no label duplicates those above.
{% endif %}

{% for theme in themes %}
[{{theme_hashes[loop.index0]}}] {{theme.name}}: {{theme.description}}
{% endfor %}

Now generate a short label for each theme:

[[ThemeLabel{ {{N}} }:theme_labels]]
